pan></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\)</span>；诱导关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a92e0473734a9033\" href=\"?note=a92e0473734a9033\" title=\"56-df-interpretation-order\">56-df-interpretation-order</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Lemmas 6.2.3–6.2.4。替换引理为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\gamma]\">\\((t\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\gamma]\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma(x)=(x\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\">\\(\\gamma(x)=(x\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\\)</span>，由项结构归纳证明。该引理给出诱导关系对替换封闭；运算逐参数严格单调给出上下文封闭；固定任意赋值把假设中的无限项下降映为 A 中无限 Q 下降，得到良基性。已读原书 pp.184–185 的证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.3–6.2.4，印刷页 184–185。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{